<http://data.silknow.org/object/e052e09f-6332-30ed-b85a-8096c8ab72b3>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "Hinchcliffe, Frances (ed.), <i>Knit One, Purl One : Historic and Contemporary Knitting from the V&A's Collection</i>. V&A, London, 1985\nHart, Avril and Susan North, <u>Historical Fashion in Detail The 17th and 18th Centuries</u>, London: V&amp;A Museum, 1998\nNorth, Susan, 'Knitted Silk Waistcoat' in North, Susan and Jenny Tiramani, eds, <u>Seventeenth-Century Women’s Dress Patterns</u>, vol.1, London: V&A Publishing, 2011, pp.88-97\nSilvana Musella Guida, 'La nascita della magliera a Napoli in età moderna/The birth of knitwear in Naples in modern times', <u>Jacquard</u>, vol.71, April 2013, pp.3-32, plate 6a, 6b."@en ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/eb7f2b33-5bde-33b7-9bbd-c6e58b0906da> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/information/bibliography> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Hinchcliffe, Frances (ed.), <i>Knit One, Purl One : Historic and Contemporary Knitting from the V&A's Collection</i>. V&A, London, 1985\nHart, Avril and Susan North, <u>Historical Fashion in Detail The 17th and 18th Centuries</u>, London: V&amp;A Museum, 1998\nNorth, Susan, 'Knitted Silk Waistcoat' in North, Susan and Jenny Tiramani, eds, <u>Seventeenth-Century Women’s Dress Patterns</u>, vol.1, London: V&A Publishing, 2011, pp.88-97\nSilvana Musella Guida, 'La nascita della magliera a Napoli in età moderna/The birth of knitwear in Naples in modern times', <u>Jacquard</u>, vol.71, April 2013, pp.3-32, plate 6a, 6b."@en .

